    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点2: 线性系统的判断",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            108,
            418,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、定义—同时满足叠加性和均匀性(齐次性)的系统称之为线性系统。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            133,
            729,
            155
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\frac{1}{b} f(t) \\xrightarrow{H} y(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            122,
            160,
            278,
            200
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、判断方法：先线性后系统 $H[a_{1}e_{1}(t)+a_{2}e_{2}(t)]=$ 先系统后线性 $a_{1}r_{1}(t)+a_{2}r_{2}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            489,
            779,
            511
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "平方 $\\Rightarrow$ 非线使",
        "bbox": [
            97,
            511,
            260,
            549
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "中括号内就是激励，让其按照系统作用变化",
        "bbox": [
            324,
            517,
            673,
            534
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {(a + b) ^ {2} \\neq a ^ {2} + b ^ {2}}{}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            95,
            561,
            235,
            610
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "images/106085befd8549933438cbf057d723a237ca760fe43386067d6b275bac49a3cf.jpg",
        "table_caption": [],
        "table_footnote": [],
        "table_body": "<table><tr><td>题目</td><td> $r(t)=e^{2}(t)$ </td></tr><tr><td>系统作用:让激励。。。。。</td><td>让激励 取平方</td></tr><tr><td>先线性后系统 $H[a_{1}e_{1}(t)+a_{2}e_{2}(t)]=$ </td><td> $[a_{1}e_{1}|t|+a_{2}e_{2}|t|]^{2}$ </td></tr><tr><td>先系统后线性 $a_{1}r_{1}(t)+a_{2}r_{2}(t)=$ </td><td> $a_{1}e_{1}^{2}|t|+a_{2}e_{2}^{2}|t|$  ②</td></tr><tr><td>综上所述,定结论</td><td>1≠② 非线性</td></tr></table>",
        "bbox": [
